{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:00:56.744Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"530e18ac9258621aed3c571ce3f1689f3bdb1e04ef54b79ce7ac9dd202ad2b9b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, here's what I found for Saltmarsh Provisions:\n\n1. Handover: Moss's Oct 5, 2025 Coastal note says the account changed hands on Monday, Oct 6, 2025. It doesn't name the new owner. The channel does point to Bettina Kroll: on Oct 15 you and she both refer to it as \"Bettina's grocery account\", and on Nov 17 she calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". So it was Bettina, from Oct 6, 2025. I'd confirm that with Bettina or Ruth before it goes in the file.\n\n2. Discount: 10%. On Nov 17, 2025 Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it to 10% (she had misread a draft worksheet).\n\n3. Corinne's admin access issue: ticket PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which is the reefer exception-report ticket from the May coverage note.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
