{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:01:00.141Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"be3c62ceffc79ba10055f910fe18b821a3fe7e37226690a7ed44d38d5b00cc02","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied in the #coastal-team thread. Here is what I told Sofia:\n\n1. **Handover:** Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says the account changed hands on Monday, Oct 6, 2025. It doesn't name the new owner. The channel points to Bettina Kroll, who is referred to as the owner (\"Bettina's grocery account\") on Oct 15 and again on Nov 17. I suggested Sofia confirm that with Bettina or Ruth before it goes in the file.\n2. **Discount:** 10%. On Nov 17, 2025 Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it to 10%. That figure was already posted in the channel, so it was fine to repeat there.\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. I flagged that PD-4824 is a different ticket, for the reefer exception report."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
